            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I did some debugging and find out the to arg to `convert_setup_ext` function is `utf-16` instead of  `utf-16be` \n<img width=\"1906\" height=\"419\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8e8a522-c33e-4c79-9d0e-178293bc9bd6\" />\n<img width=\"339\" height=\"153\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a36b226-eb6b-4f80-83f3-4f0d1193a3a4\" />\ni think thats what causing the BOM to appear \n\nSo the problem is in `enc_canonize` which converts \n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1014\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f48611a-6c90-43cd-84e1-55764859a758\" />\n\nthis https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/aa3823cca38c65696d175744175ce756d3986f23/src/nvim/mbyte.c#L2381-L2385\nconverts utf16be -> utf16 bcz of https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/aa3823cca38c65696d175744175ce756d3986f23/src/nvim/mbyte.c#L310 and https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/aa3823cca38c65696d175744175ce756d3986f23/src/nvim/mbyte.c#L190-L191\n\nShould we update the table ?\n@justinmk \n\nin neovim (version is in video) (this showcase using utf-16le that it works fine, since the table point utf16le to utf16le)\n<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/feaa2e29-0a84-4892-b378-572f194f907d\"></video>\n",
